{"id":"n82641-4-5","stage":2,"title":"틈 · 裂缝","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82641-4-5-1","ko":"그 친구는 손버릇이 좋지 않아.","zh":"那个朋友手脚不干净。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"친구는","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구는","audio":"/audio/3cc026d51b6dcef53c27.mp3"}},{"text":"손버릇이","meaning":"手脚不干净","explanation":"손버릇：手脚不干净；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손버릇","audio":"/audio/75e3a3cc40191e01b229.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63971","senseId":"2","lemma":"손버릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손버릇이","audio":"/audio/75fa38cb420c896dfcab.mp3"}},{"text":"좋지","meaning":"好、良好（习惯）","explanation":"좋다：好、良好（习惯）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"않아.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아","audio":"/audio/691c8d98a5312caac1ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"